 reused.\n- --command <argv>: runs argv directly in the working pane via\n  respawn-pane -k -c dir -- argv (no shell, no send-keys). Everything\n  after --command (or --) is the verbatim argv. With --agent it records\n  the agent in a new @proj_agent user option that proj list prefers over\n  pane process detection. Against a reused session --command is not\n  applied (exit 3, 'session exists; --command ignored'); the --json\n  object with created:false is still printed so hail can detect reuse.\n\nEnsureSession gains a command []string param and returns created bool;\na runner/newSessionHome seam makes its tmux calls unit-testable. Both\nproj contracts hold: cmdNew still never calls Goto (detached), and the\ncommand rides the existing respawn-pane -c dir call so #{session_path}\nstays $HOME.\n\nSkill + man/usage updated. Spec: hail-family-design.md §1.","timestamp":"2026-09-06T22:18:03Z","author":{"name":"Court Schuett","email":"court@subaud.io"},"committer":{"name":"Court Schuett","email":"court@subaud.io"}},"repository":{"id":1300559398,"node_id":"R_kgDOTYT2Jg","name":"tackle","full_name":"schuettc/tackle","private":false,"owner":{"login":"schuettc","id":71404236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDA0MjM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71404236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc","html_url":"https://github.com/schuettc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schuettc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s